1
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,618
Stop being a pain in the ass.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:09,617
Remember this — if I'm here, he's not.
Get that in your fucking head.

3
00:00:10,143 --> 00:00:11,898
What the fuck, Base?

4
00:00:12,516 --> 00:00:13,550
Fuck.

5
00:00:14,723 --> 00:00:15,804
Maprang.

6
00:00:23,279 --> 00:00:27,039
Hey—hey, wait!

7
00:00:29,439 --> 00:00:32,439
Hey!

8
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,639
You okay?

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,914
I love Maprang like crazy, man.

10
00:00:43,239 --> 00:00:44,113
Shit…

11
00:00:48,239 --> 00:00:50,406
And you… who the hell are you?

12
00:00:52,452 --> 00:00:56,045
Uh… I'm Gun's younger brother.

13
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,883
Huh? Didn't know he even had a brother.

14
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:30,680
Gun's knocked out.
He won't wake up until like… afternoon.

15
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,862
Yes, sir? Do you need something?

16
00:01:35,268 --> 00:01:39,919
No, just… worried about Gun, that's all.

17
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:42,987
Worried?

18
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,033
What are you worried about?

19
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:49,965
Well… when he wakes up from heavy drinking,
he sometimes does weird stuff.

20
00:01:51,589 --> 00:01:53,089
So yeah, I worry.

21
00:01:53,676 --> 00:01:57,800
But you're a guy,
so… I guess nothing's gonna happen.

22
00:01:59,290 --> 00:02:03,396
But you said Gun wouldn't wake up
until afternoon, right?

23
00:02:05,321 --> 00:02:05,910
Yeah.

24
00:02:08,015 --> 00:02:12,115
Earth…
Wanna go for a drive with me?
